WEBVTT

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:31.874
would drop the last
of their fiery orangy flowers

00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:34.418
that we would use for hopscotch in school,

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:40.007
there would be thousands and thousands
of jacaranda trees in full bloom

00:03:40.007 --> 00:03:41.175
across the city,

00:03:41.217 --> 00:03:44.011
reminding us that it was
the start of exam season.

00:03:44.011 --> 00:03:45.179
(Laughter)

00:03:45.221 --> 00:03:46.555
"Have you studied?

00:03:46.555 --> 00:03:47.723
Are you ready?"

00:03:47.765 --> 00:03:49.100
they seemed to say.

00:03:50.226 --> 00:03:52.144
We were just a part of nature.

00:03:52.144 --> 00:03:53.688
It was just a fact.

00:03:54.647 --> 00:03:56.607
And then the chainsaws came.

00:03:57.108 --> 00:03:59.819
They cut down so much of what I loved,

00:03:59.819 --> 00:04:01.696
they cut down my memories.